{"id":"1571659270","kind":"answer","title":"请问anki记忆难点的功能是什么？卡片暂停后还能恢复吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-11-12","updated":"2020-11-12","votes":33,"comment_count":28,"minutes":1,"chars":664,"keywords":["间隔重复","记忆干扰","最小信息原则","知识组织","填空练习"],"summary":"记忆难点的功能是用来帮助你识别非常难记住的卡片，通常来说是累积遗忘了8次的卡片。 这些卡片会被打上 leech 的标志，leech 意思是寄生虫，非常形象的描述了这些卡片的特点——像寄生虫一样不断消耗你的复习时间，而你却无能为力 [1] [2] 。 对于这样的卡片，我不建议恢复其暂停，而是建议直接删除，另做一张卡片。 为什么？…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/429900069/answer/1571659270","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"为什么？"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"那怎么办呢？"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"我要恢复，请告诉我怎么做！"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"OOp51exn\">记忆难点的功能是用来帮助你识别非常难记住的卡片，通常来说是累积遗忘了8次的卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"l9UxDlnk\">这些卡片会被打上 leech 的标志，leech 意思是寄生虫，非常形象的描述了这些卡片的特点——像寄生虫一样不断消耗你的复习时间，而你却无能为力<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"78nu-Ni5\">对于这样的卡片，我不建议恢复其暂停，而是建议直接删除，另做一张卡片。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">为什么？</h2><p data-pid=\"9MRH6MPN\">因为通常来说，这种卡片记不住并不是重复的次数够不够多的问题。而是这张卡片的知识点无法和你自己的知识体系产生联系。它就像无处安放的灵魂，在你的记忆里找不到可以寄居的位置（2333），其理论解释是记忆稳定性的双变量模型<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>，重复能提高分子稳定性，而寻找联系能提高结构稳定性。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">那怎么办呢？</h2><p data-pid=\"MR1kAOBm\">你需要回到原文，回到这个知识的上下文，去重新理解它，并遵循知识表述的20规则来重新制卡。</p><p data-pid=\"b-th2fP-\">具体可以参考：</p><p data-pid=\"H5mX8K5g\">本土版：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5753541fed53c1aa73f9ce332a1ac5d0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"271\" data-image-width=\"732\" data-tm-id=\"52369009\" href=\"#/post/52369009\">叶峻峣：Anki高考的20条原则(1-5)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》</a><p data-pid=\"q75ssxTj\">原版：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a52924624d23c2db3f2e1f542f0f7999_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"530\" data-image-width=\"939\" data-tm-id=\"269997143\" href=\"#/post/269997143\">叶峻峣：20 条知识表述规则（20 周年版）</a><h2 id=\"sec-3\">我要恢复，请告诉我怎么做！</h2><p data-pid=\"QD3cuPvY\">好吧，首先打开卡片浏览器</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-a842259642c87ead41f199999df42447\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a842259642c87ead41f199999df42447_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"848\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-a842259642c87ead41f199999df42447\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-a842259642c87ead41f199999df42447_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"848\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"KcEG_Pfk\">右侧找到 leech 标签</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c46d8a080f10a6b61d355b73c6f3503_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dce723be636851f3b3cd85832be03fb8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-908451be57bbcda0647f5e53d47ca815_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"258\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c46d8a080f10a6b61d355b73c6f3503_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dce723be636851f3b3cd85832be03fb8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-908451be57bbcda0647f5e53d47ca815_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"258\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"vk650Iqe\">点击左侧卡片，Ctrl + A 全选，右键》开关暂停状态</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d1f13065cf8ecf6dd8b1aa895e3a41cc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff25a2288df841f37a4a753884110f9e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dca9f9a53f767cc069986adb88e4e0ea_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1096\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d1f13065cf8ecf6dd8b1aa895e3a41cc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff25a2288df841f37a4a753884110f9e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dca9f9a53f767cc069986adb88e4e0ea_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1096\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Kz38y2z2\">好了，操作完了，如果你还想把 leech 标签给去了，点这个移除标签，选中 leech 即可。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f5f6e1bc6259e657627f1f8b7f5afcc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-398be31263f144d6512511971816549b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cd76d5752654281b2d04c75581ba62cd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"451\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f5f6e1bc6259e657627f1f8b7f5afcc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-398be31263f144d6512511971816549b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cd76d5752654281b2d04c75581ba62cd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"451\"/></figure><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 【硬核】参数模拟(续)——从“诡异”的曲线上扬到“有毒”的记忆 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/79015431\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/79015431</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 毒性记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67390960\" href=\"#/post/67390960\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 记忆稳定性的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"268782211\" href=\"#/post/268782211\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"52369009","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(1-5)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":521,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"269997143","title":"20 条知识表述规则（20 周年版）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":251,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67390960","title":"9 毒性记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":227,"minutes":24,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"268782211","title":"记忆稳定性的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":10,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"52459340","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(6-10)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":187,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"53919249","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(11-15)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":131,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"54393154","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(16-20)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":116,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"297790034","title":"基于主动回忆的学习中的知识结构与表述","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":176,"minutes":42,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"719174183","title":"如何应对记忆难点（Leech）","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":105,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1957235611","title":"被anki的参数设置绕晕了，我该如何用anki背考研专业课？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"2063035456","title":"高中生可以用anki作为系统的笔记归纳本吗（不考虑手机限制）?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":41,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 41 赞同"},{"id":"984509761","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆曲线到底有没有用？？！？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":212,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 212 赞同"},{"id":"2264896156","title":"如何有效进行背诵？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":40,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"},{"id":"1266497986","title":"anki适合学习新知识吗?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":13,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 13 赞同"}]}